<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's C.Amorim Q1 net before tax rises.</title>
<headline>Portugal's C.Amorim Q1 net before tax rises.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 1 to March 31:</p>
<p>(billion escudos, unless stated)</p>
<p>Net     0.476 vs 0.292</p>
<p>Turnover 14.3 vs 13.4  </p>
<p>Current result 0.692 vs 0.336</p>
<p>Operating cash flow 1.95 vs 1.68</p>
<p>NOTE: Corticeira Amorim SGPS is a Portuguese cork company. The company said in a statement that favourable exchange rate movements had contributed to its 6.5 percent growth in sales. It said the value of its investments, mainly in fixed assets, stood at 473 million escudos in the first quarter.</p>
</text>
